'''Uprigg''' is the [[Combinations (Classic)|combination]] of [[Upgrade (Classic)|Upgrade]] and [[Juryrigg]]'s DNA. He can only be accessed by using the [[Biomnitrix]].

==Appearance==
Uprigg has the body of [[Juryrigg]] with the circuit pattern of [[Upgrade (Classic)|Upgrade]]. His arms, legs, and stomach are slightly more rounded than Juryrigg's. Rather than a devil tip, he has a plug on the end of his tail, similar to [[Feedback]]'s. His ears and nose are longer and pointier.

The [[Biomnitrix]] symbol is located on the ring of his eye, which is Upgrade's symbol location.

==Personality==
Uprigg has the same personality as Juryrigg and laughs maniacally when he is disassembling and reassembling machinery.

==Powers and Abilities==
<gallery type="slideshow">
LDtTWA (421).png|Technological Repairment
LDtTWA (420).png|Elasticity
</gallery>
Being part-[[Galvanic Mechamorph (Classic)|Galvanic Mechamorph]], Uprigg has stretchable limbs that can reach over long distance like [[Upgrade (Classic)|Upgrade]]. He can also modify and improve technology, such as how he created the [[Time Cycles]].

Being part-[[Planchaküle]], Uprigg can break and reassemble technology much like [[Juryrigg]].

==History==
===Omniverse===
*Uprigg first appeared in ''[[Let's Do the Time War Again]]'', where he used a [[Chroniton Particle]] and the wreckage of the [[Proto-TRUK]] and the [[Tenn-Speed]] to create two [[Time Cycles]] for [[Ben Tennyson (Classic)|Ben]] and [[Rook Blonko|Rook]]. Later, Uprigg was used off-screen to craft a second pair of Time Cycles, which Ben and Rook would pilot back to their own timeline, thus becoming their own past selves.

==Appearances==
